---
// Side view: the forearm stays calm, the hand hinges at the wrist, the stick pivots
// around the fulcrum, hits the pad and bounces back up.
---

<figure class="snap figure">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 420 230" role="img" aria-label="Animation: a stick pivots down onto a pad and bounces back up while the forearm stays still.">
    <rect x="2" y="2" width="416" height="226" rx="18" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="2" />

    <!-- pad -->
    <rect x="196" y="188" width="200" height="16" rx="8" fill="#d4e9f1" stroke="var(--snare)" stroke-width="3" />

    <!-- ghost positions -->
    <g class="ghost">
      <line x1="120" y1="110" x2="293" y2="10" />
      <line x1="120" y1="110" x2="302" y2="190" />
    </g>

    <!-- moving stick -->
    <g class="stick">
      <line x1="84" y1="110" x2="320" y2="110" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round" />
      <line x1="84" y1="110" x2="320" y2="110" stroke="#e6c48a" stroke-width="4.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
    </g>

    <!-- forearm + hand (static) -->
    <line x1="18" y1="58" x2="100" y2="96" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="30" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <line x1="18" y1="58" x2="100" y2="96" stroke="#f3d3b8" stroke-width="25" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <circle cx="120" cy="110" r="13" fill="var(--accent)" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="3" />

    <!-- markers -->
    <circle cx="100" cy="96" r="11" fill="none" stroke="var(--kick)" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="4 3" />
    <g>
      <circle cx="132" cy="150" r="14" fill="var(--ink)" /><text x="132" y="155.5" text-anchor="middle" class="num">1</text>
      <circle cx="62" cy="128" r="14" fill="var(--ink)" /><text x="62" y="133.5" text-anchor="middle" class="num">2</text>
      <circle cx="360" cy="160" r="14" fill="var(--ink)" /><text x="360" y="165.5" text-anchor="middle" class="num">3</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <ol class="legend">
    <li><span class="badge">1</span> The fulcrum (thumb + index finger) is the pivot. It stays in place.</li>
    <li><span class="badge">2</span> The wrist (red dashes) is the hinge. The forearm stays calm.</li>
    <li><span class="badge">3</span> The stick hits the pad and bounces back up. Let it. Do not push it down or hold it on the pad.</li>
  </ol>
  <figcaption>The pale sticks show the "up" and "hit" positions. Reduced-motion users see the still version.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .snap { max-width: 640px; }
  svg { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
  .ghost line { stroke: var(--ink-2); stroke-width: 4; stroke-dasharray: 2 7; stroke-linecap: round; opacity: 0.45; }
  .stick { transform-origin: 120px 110px; animation: snap 1.3s infinite; }
  .num { font: 800 14px var(--font-display); fill: #fff; }
  @keyframes snap {
    0% { transform: rotate(-31deg); animation-timing-function: cubic-bezier(0.55, 0, 0.9, 0.6); }
    33% { transform: rotate(24deg); animation-timing-function: cubic-bezier(0.1, 0.5, 0.4, 1); }
    62% { transform: rotate(-27deg); animation-timing-function: ease-in-out; }
    100% { transform: rotate(-31deg); }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .stick { animation: none; transform: rotate(-31deg); }
  }
  .legend { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 1rem 0 0; display: grid; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .legend li { display: flex; gap: 0.7rem; align-items: flex-start; margin: 0; }
  .badge { flex: none; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--ink); color: #fff; display: grid; place-items: center; font: 800 0.8rem var(--font-display); }
</style>
